    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right after this, a brief flashback shows why Mishkin fled: Pasha gave him a local souvenir showing monks who were brutally killed defending the monastery, calling it 'a hint', and Mishkin replied, 'I'm weak, but I'm not stupid.'. See you next time!",
